remarks.p:
Makes the current selection into a link. The specified value is the anchor tag that
specifies link. The value must simply be the anchor tag. Example:

ultraTextEditor.EditInfo.MakeSelectionIntoLink( "<a href=\"url\"></a>" );

member.summary:
Returns the resolved value of the  property.
If the property has been set to a non-default value, that value is returned;
otherwise, the return value is based on the  property.

remarks.p:
Setting this property to true enables pan gesture processing
while the user changes position on the touch surface. This can be used,
for example, to initiate a drag operation.
